> 
> I have spent considerable time developing and executing multi-channel foodservice strategies that have effectively engaged operators across various segments, including restaurants, corporate dining, and educational institutions. My experience in direct sales has honed my ability to identify key accounts, build lasting relationships, and convert them into loyal advocates for the brands I represent. I thrive in fast-paced, mission-driven environments, and I am energized by the opportunity to contribute to a team that prioritizes collaboration and continual improvement.
> 
