> 
> Understanding the importance of post-sale support, I work diligently to maintain relationships with accounts through regular check-ins, trainings, and feedback sessions. My comprehensive knowledge of foodservice distribution channels, coupled with my familiarity with CRM tools like HubSpot and collaborative platforms such as Slack and Asana, allows me to navigate complex sales cycles efficiently and to provide valuable insights to drive product innovation and market execution.
> 
> I am particularly drawn to Little Sesame’s commitment to high-quality, thoughtfully produced products and its dedication to fostering a culture of accountability and growth. I strongly align with your mission of delivering better food for all, and I am enthusiastic about the potential to contribute to your exciting journey.
